data: {"type":"tool-input-available","toolCallId":"hcall_3_99d81bcf-fb66-4493-8051-54d0776a50a5","toolName":"vendo_apps_create","input":{"prompt":"Build a simple savings and checking balance view for a Maple banking app.\n\nFetch accounts from host_listAccounts. Find the savings account (kind === \"savings\") and checking account (kind === \"checking\").\n\nLayout:\n- Two large balance figures displayed side by side: Savings on the left, Checking on the right. The balance numbers should be the most prominent element on the screen, rendered in a large font size.\n- Below each balance, show the account name and masked account number.\n- Below the savings balance, show the APY (e.g. \"4.25% APY\").\n- Below the two balances, show a MapleSparkline for the savings account using its sparkline array.\n\nKeep the design clean and minimal. No extra chrome."},"dynamic":true}

